flowchart LR
    A[Request admitted<br/>route chosen by predictor.cpp] --> B[Prefill phase]
    B --> C[GPU analytic only<br/>cost_inputs.cpp:<br/>prefill_gpu_ms = s_time<br/>prefill_pim_ms = 0]
    C --> D{Decode tokens remain?}
    D -->|No| E[Done]
    D -->|Yes| F[WaitingDecode]

    F --> G{Route}
    G -->|gpu_only| H[Decode phase<br/>GPU analytic only]
    H --> I[maybe_complete_active_task]
    I --> J{More decode tokens?}
    J -->|Yes| F
    J -->|No| E

    G -->|hybrid| K[Decode split in ServiceEstimate]
    K --> K1[GPU analytic part<br/>qkv + prj + ff + g_etc + g2g_comm]
    K --> K2[Link analytic part<br/>c2g_comm]
    K --> K3[PIM attention path<br/>g_matmul + g_softmax]

    K3 --> L{hybrid_command_source}
    L -->|template_replay| M[trace_loader.cpp<br/>load lin_<L>.trace]
    L -->|runtime_generated| N[command_generator.cpp<br/>LogicalTemplateCommandStream]
    N --> O[layout_planner.cpp<br/>dense KvKey / KvValue layout]
    O --> P[allocator.cpp<br/>reserve request and task memory]
    P --> Q[attacc_serving_translation.cpp<br/>VA to PA]

    M --> R[pim_executor.cpp<br/>build Request and send]
    Q --> R
    R --> S[PIM_DRAM_system.cpp]
    S --> T[pim_scheduler.cpp]
    T --> U[LPDDR5-PIM.cpp]
    U --> V[callback completion]

    K1 --> W[Task completion gate]
    K2 --> W
    V --> W
    W --> X[maybe_complete_active_task waits for<br/>GPU done and link done and PIM done and E2E done]
    X --> Y{More decode tokens?}
    Y -->|Yes| F
    Y -->|No| E
